// Racing: up and down (or a tap above or below the middle) set your speed, 0 to 3; race the red
// rival two laps around the track. Take a corner at speed 3 and you spin out.
// icon: loop 3 6 21 6 21 18 3 18 dot 8 6 3 dot 16 18 3
