// Penalty shootout: left and right place your ball, space or Kick shoots it past the keeper.
// Then you keep goal: left and right move you in front of the computer's shot. Five rounds.
// icon: loop 3 5 21 5 21 15 3 15 line 3 9 21 9 dot 12 19 3
state shots = [2, 7, 4, 1, 6];  // the column of the computer's kick, round by round
