// Safe cracker: turn the dial with the arrows (or < and >); it clicks on the next number of the
// combination. Reach the 1st turning right, the 2nd left and so on; space or Try sets it.
// icon: ring 12 12 9 line 12 12 12 5 dot 12 12 2
