// Pea genetics: step each parent's color (Y/y) and shape (R/r) genes; the Punnett square shows
// their 16 children, counted by look. Tap a child to breed it as parent 1.
// icon: dot 8 8 4 dot 16 8 4 dot 8 16 4 ring 16 16 4
