// Battle tracker: add each combatant with a name, initiative and HP; Next passes the turn in
// initiative order. Tap a name to select it, then Damage or Heal by the amount.
// icon: line 4 20 15 9 line 15 9 19 5 line 10 9 15 14 ring 18 18 4
