// Flight arrival: type when the flight leaves, how long it is and how many hours ahead the
// destination is; it shows the local time you land, and the time your body still keeps.
// icon: fill 2 13 9 11 15 3 18 3 14 11 21 9 22 12 14 15 18 21 15 21 9 15 2 15
