// No Thanks for me, Sam and Jo: take the card up and its chips, or pay a chip for No thanks.
// Lowest score wins: your cards (a run counts only its lowest) less your chips.
// icon: loop 4 3 15 3 15 20 4 20 line 7 8 12 8 line 7 13 12 13 dot 19 17 3
