// Verse memory, Proverbs 3:5: Show, First letters or Hide the verse; type it word by word from
// memory, pressing Check after each. Hint gives the next word's first letter.
// icon: loop 4 3 20 3 20 21 4 21 line 8 8 16 8 line 8 12 16 12 line 8 16 13 16
