// Order and Chaos: you are Order. Pick X or O and tap an empty square; the computer, Chaos, answers.
// Five of one kind in a row wins for Order; a full board without one wins for Chaos.
// icon: line 3 4 11 12 line 11 4 3 12 ring 16 16 5
state cells = [0; 36];    // 0 empty, 1 X, 2 O
