// Patchwork: tap the quilt where the patch's top-left square goes, or Skip it. When the patches
// run out, the score: squares covered minus 2 for each empty one.
// icon: loop 3 3 21 3 21 21 3 21 fill 3 3 12 3 12 12 3 12 fill 12 12 21 12 21 21 12 21
state shapes = ["##/##", "###", "##/#.", "####", "##/##", "#/#"];
