// Baby log: Feed, Wet and Dirty log what happened; Sleep starts a nap and Wake ends it. Type a
// reminder in minutes to be told when a feed is due. The strip shows the latest 12 entries.
// icon: loop 8 9 16 9 16 21 8 21 fill 10 4 14 4 14 9 10 9 line 8 13 11 13 line 8 17 11 17
state log = [0; 0];        // what was logged, in order: 4 a feed, 3 wet, 5 dirty, 6 a nap
